  "prefLabel": "Per-A 102.02 Appeal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per-A 102.02 “Appeal” means the formal process authorized by RSA 21-I:46, RSA 21-I:52, RSA 21-I:57 or RSA 21-I:58 whereby a party can request that the personnel appeals board order modification or reversal of a decision of an appointing authority or of the director of personnel.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Per-A 100) #7377, eff 10-23-00",
